.TH LOCALEMBED-SERVER 1 "2026-03-03" "v1.0.2" "MLC LocalEmbed"
.SH NAME
localembed-server \- Fast Local Text Embedding Service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B localembed-server
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B localembed-server
provides an OpenAI-compatible embedding API using fast ONNX-based models. It runs locally and supports multiple embedding models.
.SH OPTIONS
By default, configuration is loaded from /etc/localembed/config.yaml.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/localembed/config.yaml
Configuration file.
.TP
.I /var/lib/localembed
Default data directory for models.
.TP
.I /var/log/localembed/server.log
Log file.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MLC_PORT
Port to listen on (default: 9142).
.TP
.B MLC_CACHE_DIR
Directory where models are stored.
.TP
.B ONNX_PATH
Path to libonnxruntime.so.
.SH SEE ALSO
.B localembed-cli(1)
.SH AUTHOR
Michael Lechner
